C-side: A2D round trip (nsense -> ain, threshold in the digital, dq -> nout)

model vsrc vsource
model isrc isource

vsense (nsense 0) vsrc type="pwl" wave=[0, 0, 99n, 0, 100n, 1, 200n, 1]
i_a2d (nsense 0) isrc type="pwl" file="code:libcosim_bridge.so:vacask_bridge_init:a2d:ain"
v_d2a (nout 0) vsrc type="pwl" file="code:libcosim_bridge.so:vacask_bridge_init:d2a:dq"

control
  analysis tran1 tran step=1n stop=200n
endc
